{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend your desktop in this idle auto-battler that sits quietly in the corner of your screen.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fend off endless waves of enemies, upgrade your lone tower, and grow stronger across ascensions while you go about your day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772810/extras/d2723eb37ccfb64a3ebdc9220a44dddc.poster.avif?t=1773742586\" width=231 height=231 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772810/extras/d2723eb37ccfb64a3ebdc9220a44dddc.webm?t=1773742586\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level up and unlock</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain XP, level up, and earn rewards such as permanent upgrades, powerful loot, or new weapons.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hunt for loot</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies drop rare gear with huge bonuses. Equip the best and create broken builds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ascend and grow stronger</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reset your run to earn Ascendium, unlocking cross-ascension upgrades that boost your progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772810/extras/5ffae6d7de646f7988b6aad05bd5a737.poster.avif?t=1773742586\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772810/extras/5ffae6d7de646f7988b6aad05bd5a737.webm?t=1773742586\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772810/extras/5ffae6d7de646f7988b6aad05bd5a737.mp4?t=1773742586\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Always on, never in the way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runs in a small corner of your screen so you can work, browse, or game while defending.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize your play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust size and position to fit your setup. Stay passive or play actively. It's up to you!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Wave 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3772810/a10f3aeda7f558db23483fce22241ebb4a451f67.jpg"},{"name":"Wave 5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3772810/a10f3aeda7f558db23483fce22241ebb4a451f67.jpg"},{"name":"Wave 10","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3772810/a10f3aeda7f558db23483fce22241ebb4a451f67.jpg"},{"name":"Wave 15","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3772810/a10f3aeda7f558db23483fce22241ebb4a451f67.jpg"},{"name":"Wave 20","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3772810/a10f3aeda7f558db23483fce22241ebb4a451f67.jpg"},{"name":"Wave 30","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3772810/a10f3aeda7f558db23483fce22241ebb4a451f67.jpg"},{"name":"Wave 40","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3772810/a10f3aeda7f558db23483fce22241ebb4a451f67.jpg"},{"name":"Wave 50","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3772810/a10f3aeda7f558db23483fce22241ebb4a451f67.jpg"},{"name":"Wave 60","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3772810/a10f3aeda7f558db23483fce22241ebb4a451f67.jpg"},{"name":"Wave 70","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3772810/a10f3aeda7f558db23483fce22241ebb4a451f67.jpg"}],"total":80},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3772810?t=1773742586","backgr